<p>Brand made the series available on his <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjBdRnkOB5P85yki3rAvGUw">YouTube channel</a>, with these words: “Anybody is welcome to use anything from this series in any way they like… Hack away. Do credit the BBC, who put considerable time and talent into the project.” And he added the noteworthy footnote: “this was one of the first television productions made entirely in digital—shot digital, edited digital.”</p>
